{
"#name"
:
{
"docker"
:
null
,
"zh"
:
"增强型 docker 命令"
,
"en"
:
"Enhanced docker command"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"基于 x-cmd 封装原生 Docker 命令，提供更友好的交互式操作界面与快捷命令，简化容器与镜像管理流程，提升日常开发与运维效率。"
,
"en"
:
"A wrapper around native Docker commands powered by x-cmd, offering interactive UIs and shortcut commands to simplify container and image management for improved developer and DevOps workflows."
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"zh"
:
"交互式环境默认设置了一个别名 `alias xd='x docker'`"
,
"en"
:
"The interactive environment has a default alias set as `alias xd='x docker'`"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:Integrations"
:
[
"lz"
,
"fz"
]
,
"#subcmd:Snap"
:
[
"alpine|alp"
,
"ubuntu|ubu"
,
"kali|kal"
,
"debian|deb"
,
"fedora|fed"
,
"snap"
]
,
"#subcmd:Enhancement Config"
:
[
"daemon|d"
,
"mirror"
,
"info"
,
"init|--init"
,
"cfg|--cfg"
,
"cur|--cur"
]
,
"#subcmd:Enhancement Image"
:
[
"images"
,
"image|img"
,
"ecpull"
,
"refit"
]
,
"#subcmd:Enhancement Container"
:
[
"setup"
,
"container"
,
"ps"
,
"run"
,
"exec"
,
"network|nw"
,
"snapx"
]
,
"lz"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"通过 lazydocker 图形界面管理 Docker 容器、镜像、网络等资源"
,
"en"
:
"Manage Docker containers, images, networks, and more via the lazydocker TUI"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-cmd-advise://lazydocker/advise.t.jso"
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x docker lz"
,
"zh"
:
"通过 lazydocker 图形界面管理 Docker 容器、镜像、网络等资源"
,
"en"
:
"Manage Docker containers, images, networks, and more via the lazydocker TUI"
}
]
}
,
"fz"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"基于 fzf 的交互式 Docker 管理界面，支持容器与镜像的快速选择与操作"
,
"en"
:
"Interactive Docker management interface powered by fzf, allowing quick access to containers and images"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://docker/data/fz.jso"
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x docker fz"
,
"zh"
:
"打开交互式界面，浏览并操作正在运行的容器"
,
"en"
:
"Open an interactive interface to browse and manage running containers"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x docker fz img"
,
"zh"
:
"打开交互式界面，查看本地镜像并执行删除、运行等操作"
,
"en"
:
"Open an interactive interface to view local images and perform actions like remove or run"
}
]
}
,
"alpine|alp"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"基于 alpine 镜像的软件沙盒"
,
"en"
:
"Alpine based application sandbox"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://docker/data/alpine.jso"
}
,
"ubuntu|ubu"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"基于 ubuntu 镜像的软件沙盒"
,
"en"
:
"Ubuntu based application sandbox"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://docker/data/ubuntu.jso"
}
,
"kali|kal"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"基于 kali 镜像的软件沙盒"
,
"en"
:
"Kali based application sandbox"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://docker/data/kali.jso"
}
,
"debian|deb"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"基于 debian 镜像的软件沙盒"
,
"en"
:
"Debian based application sandbox"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://docker/data/debian.jso"
}
,
"fedora|fed"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"基于 fedora 镜像的软件沙盒"
,
"en"
:
"Fedora based application sandbox"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://docker/data/fedora.jso"
}
,
"daemon|d"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Manages the Docker daemon, allowing configuration of proxies, registry sources, and restarts."
,
"zh"
:
"管理 Docker 守护进程，可配置代理、镜像源以及重启。"
}
,
"#tip:note"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"This command modifies the /etc/docker/daemon.json file to configure the docker daemon, so it uses the sudo module to run.\n"
,
"zh"
:
"该命令修改 /etc/docker/daemon.json 文件来配置 docker daemo，因此使用了 sudo 模块来运行命令。\n"
}
]
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://docker/data/daemon.jso"
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x docker daemon mirror set https://docker.m.daocloud.io"
,
"en"
:
"Set the docker mirror to \"https://docker.m.daocloud.io\""
,
"zh"
:
"设置 docker 镜像源为 \"https://docker.m.daocloud.io\""
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x docker daemon mirror info"
,
"en"
:
"View the configuration mirror"
,
"zh"
:
"查看设置的镜像源"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x docker daemon proxy set 127.0.0.1:7070"
,
"en"
:
"Set the daemon proxy to 127.0.0.1:7070"
,
"zh"
:
"设置 daemon 代理为 127.0.0.1:7070"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x docker daemon proxy unset"
,
"en"
:
"Unset daemon proxy"
,
"zh"
:
"取消设置 daemon 代理"
}
]
}
,
"mirror"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Configure the default mirror and pull images from either this source or a specified one"
,
"zh"
:
"配置默认镜像源，并从该镜像源或者指定的镜像源中拉取镜像"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://docker/data/mirror.jso"
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x docker mirror set \"docker.m.daocloud.io\""
,
"en"
:
"Set \"docker.m.daocloud.io\" as the default mirror for pull image"
,
"zh"
:
"设置 \"docker.m.daocloud.io\" 为拉取镜像的默认镜像源"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x docker mirror pull hello-world"
,
"en"
:
"Pull the image from the default mirror"
,
"zh"
:
"从默认镜像源中拉取镜像"
}
]
}
,
"setup"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Inject x-cmd into docker container"
,
"zh"
:
"向 docker 容器中注入 x-cmd"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Container name"
,
"zh"
:
"容器名"
}
,
"#exec:stdout"
:
"xrc docker && ___x_cmd_docker____advise_conatiner_name_ls"
}
}
,
"refit"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Rebuild the specified Docker image"
,
"zh"
:
"重构指定的 Docker 镜像"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://docker/data/refit.jso"
}
,
"snap"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Run the specified package. If the image is not available locally, it will be built automatically"
,
"zh"
:
"运行指定的软件包，如果本地没有该镜像，会自动构建"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://docker/data/snap.jso"
}
,
"snapx"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"以交互方式进入指定的容器，并执行命令"
,
"en"
:
"Interactively enter a specified container and run a command."
}
,
"--name|-n"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"指定要进入的容器名称。"
,
"en"
:
"Specify the name of the container to enter."
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"容器名称"
,
"en"
:
"Container name"
}
}
}
,
"--pwd"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"设置容器内的工作目录，默认继承当前路径。"
,
"en"
:
"Set the working directory inside the container. Defaults to current path."
}
}
,
"--env|-e"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"设置传入容器的环境变量，格式为 KEY=VALUE。"
,
"en"
:
"Set environment variables to pass into the container, in KEY=VALUE format."
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"environment variables"
,
"zh"
:
"环境变量"
}
}
}
,
"--ws"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"设置容器使用的工作空间路径（即主机目录挂载点）。"
,
"en"
:
"Specify the workspace path to mount into the container from the host."
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"workspace path"
,
"zh"
:
"工作空间路径"
}
}
}
,
"--user"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"指定容器中运行命令的用户（如 root、nobody 等）。"
,
"en"
:
"Set the user to run the command as inside the container (e.g., root, nobody)."
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"user"
,
"zh"
:
"用户"
}
}
}
,
"--root|-r"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"以 root 身份运行容器中的命令，等同于 `--user root`。"
,
"en"
:
"Run the command in the container as root. Equivalent to `--user root`."
}
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"要在容器中执行的命令（如 sh、bash）"
,
"en"
:
"The command to execute inside the container (e.g., sh, bash)."
}
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x docker snapx --name xal-jq"
,
"zh"
:
"启动名为 xal-jq 的容器并进入交互式 shell。"
,
"en"
:
"Start an interactive shell in the container named xal-jq."
}
]
}
,
"image|img"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Manage images"
,
"zh"
:
"管理镜像"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://docker/data/image.jso"
}
,
"images"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
