:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"List containers"
,
"zh"
:
"列出容器"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://docker/data/ps.jso"
}
,
"run"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Create and run a new container from an image"
,
"zh"
:
"从镜像创建并运行一个新容器"
}
,
"--dind"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"The container was mounted with `/var/run/docker.sock`, granting it control over the Docker daemon."
,
"zh"
:
"往容器内挂载 /var/run/docker.sock, 从而容器可控制 docker daemon"
}
}
,
"--pwd"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Current directory was mounted to the container's `/p` directory."
,
"zh"
:
"当前目录挂载到容器内的 /p 目录"
}
}
,
"--home"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Home directory was mounted to the container's `/h` directory."
,
"zh"
:
"当前用户的 home 目录挂载到容器内的 /h 目录"
}
}
,
"-x"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Install x-cmd in a new container"
,
"zh"
:
"在容器里面安装 x-cmd"
}
}
,
"$ref"
:
